          "id": "about",
          "text": "About I’m a focused and motivated developer with a passion for software development and artificial intelligence. I enjoy building smart, practical solutions to real-world problems. With a strong understanding of core concepts and hands-on project experience, I’m always eager to learn new things and use technology to make a positive impact. Birthday: 02 January 2003 Phone: +880 1521781591 City: Rangpur, Gaibandha Email: alfezafarzine@gmail.com Interests Software Development DevOps Machine Learning Computer Vision Natural Language Processing Agentic AI Algorithms Image Processing"
        },
        {
          "id": "education",
          "text": "Education B.Sc in Software Engineering March 2022 - Present HSC. in Cantonment Public School & College, Rangpur July 2018 - January 2021 SSC in Khamar Dashlia Adarsha High School January 2013 - February 2018 Online Certification Convolutional Neural Networks Course Certificate Improving Deep Neural Networks Hyperparameter Certificate Neural Network and Deep Learning Certificate ML Olympiad VisionX 2025, AI-powered National Innovation Challenge National Steam Olympiad Game of Datathon Computer Vision Certificate by Kaggle Mechnovation"
        },
        {
          "id": "experience",
          "text": "Experience Kite Games Studio Nov 2025 - Feb 2026 Software Engineer Intern (Machine Learning) Fine-tuned DL models like Kontext.dev, using LoRA, improving model efficiency for in-house projects. Applied prompt engineering techniques to optimize generative AI outputs for game-related applications. Documented workflows and presented findings to the team, ensuring reproducibility and knowledge transfer. App-concept.com GmbH May 2025 - Oct 2025 Software Engineer Intern (Frontend) Built and maintained responsive web applications using Next.js, enhancing user experience and performance. Implemented reusable UI components and optimized state management. Worked closely with designers using Figma to translate wireframes into production-ready features. SUST ACM Student Chapter September 2023 - September 2025 Technical Executive Collaborated with a team to organize technical events, workshops, and seminars, enhancing the technical skills of students. Arrange problem solving sessions and coding competitions to foster a competitive spirit among students. Gaibandha Student Association, SUST March 2025 - January 2026 Vice-President Led the Gaibandha Student Association at SUST, organizing events and activities to foster community engagement and support for students from Gaibandha. Create Gaibandha Student Association website to provide information about the association's activities, events, and resources for students. Competitions Experience University Innovation Hub Program, SUST 2nd Cohort - 2024 2nd Runner up ML Olympiad-2024 Google TensorFlow User Community Contest - 2024 2nd place out of 69 teams DL SPRINT 3.0 BUET CSE Fest - 2024 Top 10th place out of 145 teams Bhashamul: Bengali Regional IPA Transcription UIU Computer Club - 2024 Top 15th place out of 39 teams Hackathons & Competitive Programming Participated in multiple hackathons, sometimes as team lead, with experience in full-stack development Codeforces: Highest Rating: 1039, 500+ problems solved"
        },
