      "sections": [],
      "project_text": "Chol-Kheli Tech Stack : NodeJS, ExpressJS, NextJS, Web Socket, MySQL Github URL : Project Link Developed an online auction platform for cricket and football players, featuring live bidding, team and player management, and admin controls to facilitate seamless team formation and tournament setup The project was developed as a part of my BSc in course project at the University. It was a collaborative effort with my team members, and I played a key role in the backend development using NodeJS and ExpressJS, as well as implementing real-time features using Web Socket. The platform allows users to register, create teams, and participate in live auctions for players, enhancing the overall experience of managing sports teams online.",
