      "sections": [],
      "project_text": "DP-Learning App Tech Stack : Flutter, Dart, Riverpod, NodeJS, ExpressJS, MongoDB, Google Map, Gemini api Github URL : Project Link This is a mobile application designed to help users learn about design patterns in software development. It provides a user-friendly interface for exploring various design patterns, understanding their concepts, and implementing them in real-world scenarios. The app includes features such as interactive tutorials, code examples, quizzes, and a community forum for discussions. It aims to enhance the learning experience by providing practical insights and hands-on exercises related to design patterns.",
      "links": [
        {
          "url": "https://github.com/Farzine/Design-Pattern-Learning-App",
          "label": "Project Link"
        }
      ],
      "images": []
    },
