      "project_text": "FarmAI Tech Stack : NodeJS, NextJS, ExpressJS, MongoDB, Finetuned Yollo Model, GPT-API Website URL : farm-ai-fz.vercel.app Github URL : Project Link A deep learning-based crop disease detection and prevention system using YOLO, integrated with a related marketplace to support farmers with actionable insights and relevant resources. FarmAI is a comprehensive solution designed to assist farmers in identifying and managing crop diseases. By leveraging advanced deep learning techniques, the platform provides real-time disease detection and actionable insights, empowering farmers to make informed decisions. The integration of a marketplace further enhances the user experience by offering relevant resources and products tailored to their needs.",
      "links": [
