      "project_text": "ICAP-2025 Tech Stack : NodeJS, NextJS, ExpressJS, TailwindCSS, MongoDB, SSLCOMMERZ Website URL : icap2025.sust.edu Built the official website for ICAP 2025 at SUST to provide conference information, facilitate participant registration, and manage schedules, announcements, and updates for attendees and organizers. The website serves as a comprehensive platform for the International Conference on Advanced Physics (ICAP) 2025, offering essential details about the conference, including schedules, speaker information, and registration options. It also features a user-friendly interface for participants to access important announcements and updates related to the event.",
