      "project_text": "ICERIE-2025 Tech Stack : NodeJS, NextJS, ExpressJS, MongoDB, SUST e-payments, Javascript, Cloudinary Website URL : icerie2025.sust.edu Developed the official website for ICERIE 2025 at SUST to showcase conference details, manage registrations and payments, display schedules, and provide updates for participants and organizers. Implemented a user-friendly interface using NextJS and NodeJS, allowing participants to easily access information and updates related to the conference.",
