      "sections": [],
      "project_text": "IICT-SUST Tech Stack : NextJS, NodeJS, PostgreSQL, Nodemailer, Cloudinary Website URL : iict-sust-swe.vercel.app IICT-SUST is a comprehensive web application designed to facilitate the management of student information, course details, and faculty data for the Institute of Information and Communication Technology (IICT) at Shahjalal University of Science and Technology (SUST). The application features a user-friendly interface that allows students to register, view their courses, and access faculty information. Faculty members can manage their profiles and courses efficiently. The backend is powered by NodeJS with PostgreSQL as the database, ensuring robust data handling and security. The application also integrates Nodemailer for email notifications and Cloudinary for image storage.",
      "links": [
        {
          "url": "https://iict-sust-swe.vercel.app/",
          "label": "iict-sust-swe.vercel.app"
        }
      ],
