      "project_text": "Waste Management App Tech Stack : Flutter, Firebase, Google Auth Github URL : Project Link The Waste Management App is a mobile application designed to facilitate the management and recycling of waste materials. It provides users with a platform to report waste issues, find recycling centers, and learn about proper waste disposal methods. The app integrates with Firebase for data storage and retrieval, and it uses Google Authentication for secure user login.",
